</span><span begin="02:09.330" end="02:11.340">change</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.700" end="02:19.320"><span begin="02:14.700" end="02:15.180">and </span><span begin="02:15.180" end="02:15.270">the </span><span begin="02:15.270" end="02:16.050">bird </span><span begin="02:16.050" end="02:16.440">you </span><span begin="02:16.440" end="02:17.160">cannot </span><span begin="02:17.160" end="02:19.320">change</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.200" end="02:28.050"><span begin="02:22.200" end="02:22.830">and </span><span begin="02:22.830" end="02:22.980">this </span><span begin="02:22.980" end="02:23.700">bird </span><span begin="02:23.700" end="02:24.090">you </span><span begin="02:24.090" end="02:24.810">cannot </span><span begin="02:24.810" end="02:28.050">change</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.580" end="02:35.880"><span begin="02:29.580" end="02:30.780">Lord </span><span begin="02:30.780" end="02:31.860">knows </span><span begin="02:31.860" end="02:32.010">I </span><span begin="02:32.010" end="02:32.430">can't </span><span begin="02:32.430" end="02:35.880">change</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:09.840" end="03:14.700"><span begin="03:09.840" end="03:10.530">Bye </span><span begin="03:10.530" end="03:11.190">bye </span><span begin="03:11.190" end="03:12.000">baby </span><span begin="03:12.000" end="03:12.240">it's </span><span begin="03:12.240" end="03:12.540">been </span><span begin="03:12.540" end="03:13.230">sweet </span><span begin="03:13.230" end="03:14.700">love</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:17.820" end="03:21.840"><span begin="03:17.820" end="03:18.240">though </span><span begin="03:18.240" end="03:18.630">this </span><span begin="03:18.630" end="03:19.860">feeling </span><span begin="03:19.860" end="03:20.280">I </span><span begin="03:20.280" end="03:20.730">can't </span><span begin="03:20.730" end="03:21.840">change</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:25.770" end="03:31.140"><span begin="03:25.770" end="03:26.400">Please </span><span begin="03:26.400" end="03:27.030">don't </span><span begin="03:27.030" end="03:28.230">take </span><span begin="03:28.230" end="03:28.320">it </span><span begin="03:28.320" end="03:28.800">so </span><span begin="03:28.800" end="03:31.140">badly</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:33.630" end="03:38.190"><span begin="03:33.630" end="03:33.960">coz </span><span begin="03:33.960" end="03:34.050">the </span><span begin="03:34.050" end="03:35.070">Lord </span><span begin="03:35.070" end="03:36.240">knows </span><span begin="03:36.240" end="03:36.600">I </span><span begin="03:36.600" end="03:36.870">must </span><span begin="03:36.870" end="03:38.190">play</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:42.120" end="03:48.060"><span begin="03:42.120" end="03:42.480">If </span><span begin="03:42.480" end="03:42.990">I </span><span begin="03:42.990" end="03:44.190">stay </span><span begin="03:44.190" end="03:44.430">here </span><span begin="03:44.430" end="03:44.940">with </span><span begin="03:44.940" end="03:45.930">you </span><span begin="03:45.930" end="03:48.060">girl</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:50.070" end="03:55.650"><span begin="03:50.070" end="03:50.670">things </span><span begin="03:50.670" end="03:51.120">just </span><span begin="03:51.120" end="03:52.140">couldn't </span><span begin="03:52.140" end="03:52.650">be </span><span begin="03:52.650" end="03:52.800">the </span><span begin="03:52.800" end="03:55.650">same</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:57.900" end="04:03.750"><span begin="03:57.900" end="03:58.260">Coz </span><span begin="03:58.260" end="03:58.530">I'm </span><span begin="03:58.530" end="03:59.160">as </span><span begin="03:59.160" end="04:00.330">free </span><span begin="04:00.330" end="04:00.840">as </span><span begin="04:00.840" end="04:00.900">a </span><span begin="04:00.900" end="04:02.010">bird </span><span begin="04:02.010" end="04:03.750">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:06.240" end="04:10.980"><span begin="04